# Dev: don't hardcode NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE. frontend api.ts infers the gateway
# URL at client runtime from `window.location.hostname:8000` — wherever the
# browser loads the frontend from (local localhost / private-network hostname / SSH
# tunnel forward / LAN IP), the gateway is on that host's :8000, no rebuild and
# no per-device env switching required.
#
# For public deployments (Vercel + Cloudflare Tunnel splitting frontend / backend
# across hosts), set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE to an absolute URL in deploy env to
# take the hardcoded path.
